@prefix norma: <https://w3id.org/def/norma-o#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix : <https://example.org/cp#> .
<https://example.org/cp> a owl:Ontology ; owl:imports <https://w3id.org/def/norma-o> .
:R a owl:NamedIndividual, norma:LegalRole .
:x a owl:NamedIndividual, norma:LegalAction .
:P1 a owl:NamedIndividual, norma:Permission ;
    norma:deonticId "P1" ; norma:hasLegalAgent :R ; norma:hasLegalAction :x .
:F1 a owl:NamedIndividual, norma:Prohibition ;
    norma:deonticId "F1" ; norma:hasLegalAgent :R ; norma:hasLegalAction :x .
